<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-917] LocalBookKeeperTest seems to be silently failing</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-917</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve noticed this while inspecting the output in jenkins:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Running org.apache.bookkeeper.client.BookKeeperCloseTest
Tests run: 10, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, Time elapsed: 12.074 sec
Running org.apache.bookkeeper.client.LocalBookKeeperTest
Running org.apache.bookkeeper.meta.GcLedgersTest
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It sounds like &lt;tt&gt;LocalBookKeeperTest&lt;/tt&gt; is failing silently. Is it hanging and timing out?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/bookkeeper-master-git-pullrequest/57/console&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/bookkeeper-master-git-pullrequest/57/console&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12956808">BOOKKEEPER-917</key>
            <summary>LocalBookKeeperTest seems to be silently failing</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
